WEBVTT

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:34.116
It is 50 actions for 2050,

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:38.396
ranging from the first-ever
European climate law,

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:40.286
to circular economy,

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:42.651
to a biodiversity strategy,

00:01:42.675 --> 00:01:44.336
planting trees,

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:46.976
protecting precious nature and animals,

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.790
recycling and waste management,

00:01:49.814 --> 00:01:51.314
just to name a few.

00:01:52.797 --> 00:01:55.686
When the coronavirus pandemic hit,

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:59.373
we resolved not to let
our objective be derailed.